    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah i checked the cpu and it seems fine, load is staying under 20%. i also ran a long ping test and the packet loss is really inconsistent. sometimes it's clean for 10 minutes, then suddenly we get a burst of drops. \n\ncould this be something else like interference or maybe a bad cable/transceiver causing the spikes? it just feels so random.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
